<description>&lt;p&gt;Ukrainian naval drones have struck two Russian vessels at Libya's Benghazi naval base and off its coast, sinking one warship and damaging another, extending a series of drone attacks on Russian ships in Libyan waters. Libyan forces continue shelling Haftar positions while some Haftar militia have surrendered at a strategic airbase, and Turkish officials have publicly welcomed a motion supporting the troops. An armed group blocked the Hamada oil pipeline for over 20 days, causing $31 million in losses for the National Oil Corporation. The conflict still recorded 2 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/videos/c6wy93q5wwqvo?at_medium=RSS&amp;amp;at_campaign=rss&quot;&gt;BBC News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cm894p88jzxpo?at_medium=RSS&amp;amp;at_campaign=rss&quot;&gt;BBC News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.france24.com/en/libya-s-east-seeks-un-probe-into-claims-ukrainian-military-present-in-west&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.france24.com/en/tv-shows/the-debate/20261123-how-far-will-ukraine-war-spread-kyiv-targets-russian-vessels-in-libya&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.france24.com/en/ukraine-claims-it-sank-russian-warship-off-libya&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/23/world/europe/ukraine-libya-russian-ships.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.washingtonpost.com/world/2026/11/23/ukraine-says-it-sank-russian-warship-off-coast-libya-far-front-line/&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/23/ukraine-releases-footage-of-strikes-on-two-russian-vessels-off-libya&quot;&gt;Euronews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bbc.co.uk/ne